    "detailed_description": "The system administrator simulator is a sandbox in which you can try on the role of a system administrator in offices of different types and sizes and even remotely!<br>Every new game day you will face different tasks and problems in the office where you work. Scared users will come running to you and tell you that their keyboard is not working and the printer has stopped printing. Will you be able to solve all the problems effectively, or will you accumulate a lot of debts on tasks and violate the SLA? Or maybe you will be able to teach users how to solve their own minor problems, while you drink coffee at home? It all depends on you!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.poster.avif?t=1751741883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.webm?t=1751741883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.mp4?t=1751741883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this game you are waiting for:<br>- Simulation of computer networks and devices.<br>- Dynamic system of events and various breakdowns.<br>- Variability and the ability to influence the gameplay with your own decisions.<br>- Generating user problems from a variety of different options that you need to diagnose and solve.<br>- Setting up network equipment.<br>- Troubleshooting computer networks and systems.<br>- Time management.",
    "about_the_game": "The system administrator simulator is a sandbox in which you can try on the role of a system administrator in offices of different types and sizes and even remotely!<br>Every new game day you will face different tasks and problems in the office where you work. Scared users will come running to you and tell you that their keyboard is not working and the printer has stopped printing. Will you be able to solve all the problems effectively, or will you accumulate a lot of debts on tasks and violate the SLA? Or maybe you will be able to teach users how to solve their own minor problems, while you drink coffee at home? It all depends on you!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.poster.avif?t=1751741883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.webm?t=1751741883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/240b07f3290ae72fa34f6dcf89ac16e0.mp4?t=1751741883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this game you are waiting for:<br>- Simulation of computer networks and devices.<br>- Dynamic system of events and various breakdowns.<br>- Variability and the ability to influence the gameplay with your own decisions.<br>- Generating user problems from a variety of different options that you need to diagnose and solve.<br>- Setting up network equipment.<br>- Troubleshooting computer networks and systems.<br>- Time management.",
    "short_description": "The SysAdmin simulator is a sandbox in which you can try on the role of a system administrator. Every new game day you will face different tasks and problems in the office where you work.",
